<title>Team calendar app: where it stands</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600&display=swap">
<style>:root{color-scheme:light only;supported-color-schemes:light}</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F1F3F4">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#F1F3F4" style="background-color:#F1F3F4">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 16px">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="640" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="width:100%;max-width:640px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E3E6E8;border-radius:16px">
<tr><td style="padding:32px 32px 32px 24px">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 0 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="border-left:3px solid #2E4A66;padding:0 0 0 16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Where the team calendar app stands:</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Done<br>- Calendar, tasks, emails, team workload and weekly update emails, in one place.<br>- Emails become calendar entries only after a person approves them.<br>- Reminders are drafted for a person to send. Nothing is sent automatically.<br>- All 11 team profiles are set up.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Waiting on<br>- The calendar system token<br>- Company email sign-in<br>- The Claude key<br>- The database key<br>- The email template</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Next<br>- Connect the calendar system and run the first real day.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Needed from you<br>- Check the spelling of the 11 names.<br>- Decide what to do with the three calendars that did not match anyone.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
